<title>UK: GOLF-BJORN NAMED GOLFER OF THE MONTH.</title>
<headline>GOLF-BJORN NAMED GOLFER OF THE MONTH.</headline>
<dateline>ST ANDREWS, Scotland 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thomas Bjorn, the first Dane to win on the European Tour, has been voted the tour's Golfer of the Month for September.</p>
<p>Bjorn won the Loch Lomond World Invitational in Scotland three weeks ago. He was also sixth in the European Open in Ireland and seventh at the European Masters in Switzerland.</p>
</text>
